 class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">Introducing Agent 4 =
=E2=80=94 our fastest, most versatile Agent yet. It's built around a simple=
 idea: you should spend your time creating, not coordinating. Agent 4 takes=
 on the tedious-but-necessary work in the background so you can stay in cre=
ative flow and ship production-ready software 10x faster. Because Replit is=
 where software is built, run, and shipped =E2=80=94 all in one place =E2=
=80=94 Agent 4 can handle both the complex and the mundane, so you can focu=
s on what's uniquely human: creativity.</p><h2 id=3D"summary" class=3D"text=
-3xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-48 mb-24">Summary</h2><p class=3D"hover=
:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">Agent 4 is built on four pillars de=
signed to keep you in creative flow and ship production-ready apps 10X fast=
er.</p><ul class=3D"list-disc"><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Generate=
 design variants on an infinite canvas, tweak them visually, and apply the =
best one directly in your app.</li><li><strong>Move Faster:</strong> Tackle=
 auth, database, back-end functionality and front-end design all at once wi=
th parallel agents, with progress across tasks clearly visible. Once done, =
tasks can be merged seamlessly into the main app.</li><li><strong>Ship Anyt=
hing:</strong> Create mobile and web apps, landing pages, decks, videos and=
 more in the same project, with shared context and design so you can scale =
efficiently.</li><li><strong>Build Together:</strong> You and your team can=
 focus on planning your app while the Agent handles all the messy coordinat=
ion and execution. Submit requests in any order, and Agent 4 intelligently =
sequences them and executes in the best order.</li></ul><p class=3D"hover:p=
rose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">With Agent 3, we pushed autonomy forw=
ard. Agent could run for hours independently- self-testing, fixing issues, =
and driving builds ahead on its own. At the time, it set a new bar for auto=
nomous vibe-coding agents and showed what was possible when software could =
move without constant oversight.</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBr=
andLighter mb-24">That breakthrough unlocked something important: once the =
mechanics of building can run independently, the next frontier is creative =
control.</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24"><stron=
g>With Agent 4, we=E2=80=99re building on that foundation by putting human =
creativity at the center of the process.</strong></p><h2 id=3D"agent-4" cla=
