><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">One of the bigges=
t reasons building with an Agent can break your flow is the coordination ov=
erhead. When everything runs through a linear chat thread, you can end up s=
pending more time managing the process than actually moving the project for=
ward.</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">Agent 4 r=
eimagines collaboration to work more like a great team: clear priorities, v=
isible progress, parallel execution, and clean handoffs.</p><p class=3D"hov=
er:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">That=E2=80=99s why we=E2=80=99re =
introducing a task-based workflow. Team members can send multiple design or=
 build requests at the same time and every request to Agent 4 is broken int=
o discrete tasks that run in parallel in the background. You can track the =
status of each task, review the results, and approve them before they=E2=80=
=99re merged into your main project. Agent 4 intelligently sequences and ex=
ecutes them in the optimal order.</p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentB=
randLighter mb-24">The result: less overhead, more flow.</p><ul class=3D"li=
st-disc"><li>Plan or design while the Agent builds in parallel, no more con=
stant context switching</li><li>Submit requests in any order. Agent 4 handl=
es dependencies and sequencing</li><li>Stay hands-on where it matters, desi=
gning or vibe coding critical pieces of your app while the Agent works in t=
he background on other tasks</li></ul><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accent=
BrandLighter mb-24">Together, this unlocks faster iteration, easier experim=
entation, and more effective collaboration.</p><hr class=3D"h-[1px] bg-outl=
ineDimmer w-full"><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBrandLighter mb-24">=
<em class=3D"italic">Agent 4 is a game-changer. Multi-user vibe coding via =
the kanban is a significant milestone for enterprises. It=E2=80=99s great f=
or turning individual concepts into team realities and managing tasks throu=
gh diverse role definitions</em></p><p class=3D"hover:prose-a:text-accentBr=
andLighter mb-24"><strong><em class=3D"italic">~ Takeshi Fujiwara, Director=
 , SMFL Digital Labs</em></strong></p><hr class=3D"h-[1px] bg-outlineDimmer=
 w-full"><h2 id=3D"4.-create-everything-you-need-in-one-project" class=3D"t=
ext-3xl font-semibold leading-tight mt-48 mb-24">4. Create everything you n=
eed in one project</h2><figure class=3D"flex flex-col items-center my-16"><=
