ross all your apps</h2><p class=3D"text-foregroundDimmest text-lg line-clam=
p-3">Replit is the most secure place to vibe code. Today, we're making it d=
ramatically easier to use the Security Center to understand your security p=
osture across all Replit projects in your business. We=E2=80=99re also maki=
ng it possible to remediate urgent security holes, such as active critical =
vulnerabilities on multiple published projects, in seconds.

